  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#8ef5ff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_WILD
    value: <style=title><color=#f97baf><size=34>WILD</style></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=32>5 <color=#c3a0ff>{2:CommaNumber}</color>

      4 <color=#c3a0ff>{1:CommaNumber}</color>

      3 <color=#c3a0ff>{0:CommaNumber}</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_WILD
    value: "<size=21><b>Wild</b> appears on reels 2-5 \non both arrays,\nbut on the
      lower array,\nCopied Wild can appear on reel 1.\n<b>Wild</b> substitutes for
      all symbols\nexcept              and              ."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_SCATTER
    value: <style=title><color=#f97baf><size=34>SCATTER</style></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_SCATTER
    value: '<size=21><b>1 Scatter</b> on reel <b>5</b> of each array,

      <b>2 Scatters</b> in total triggers

      <b><color=#c3a0ff>Queen''s Bounty Free Games</b></color>.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_WILD FEATURE
    value: <style=title><color=#f97baf><size=34>WILD COPY FEATURE</style></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_WILD FEATURE
    value: "<size=24>-              on upper array during <b>Base Game</b>\n   will
      be copied to lower array.\n\n- During <b>Free Games</b>, <b>Wild Copy Feature</b>\n
      \ occurs in both directions."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><color=#f97baf><size=42>RE-SPIN FEATURE</style></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=24>- <b>6</b> or more <b>Re-Spin symbols</b> anywhere\n  on both
      arrays triggers <b>Re-Spin Feature</b>.\n\n- The amount of <b>Re-Spins</b> is
      the same as the\n  number of triggering <b>Re-Spin symbols</b>.\n\n- During
      <b>Re-Spin Feature</b>, only <b>Re-spin</b> and\n  <b>blank symbols</b> appear
      on reels.\n\n- <b>Re-Spin symbol</b> appears with coin values only.\n\n- There
      are <b>4 Jackpots</b> in total.\n\n     - In order to win a <b>Jackpot</b>,
      player accumulates\n       <b>Re-Spin symbols</b> from both arrays until the\n
      \      <b>Re-Spin Feature</b> ends.\n\n     - The more <b>Re-Spin symbols</b>
      collected,\n       the higher Jackpot to win at the end.\n\n          - Required
      amount of <b>Re-Spin symbols</b>\n            to win following Jackpots:\n               -
      <b><color=#c3a0ff>Mini</b></color>      <b>15</b> or more <b>Re-Spin symbols</b>\n
      \              - <b><color=#c3a0ff>Minor</b></color>   <b>18</b> or more <b>Re-Spin
      symbols</b>\n               - <b><color=#c3a0ff>Major</b></color>   <b>22</b>
      or more <b>Re-Spin symbols</b>\n               - <b><color=#c3a0ff>Mega</b></color>
      \   <b>26</b> or more <b>Re-Spin symbols</b>\n\n     - Only highest Jackpot
      could be won."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: '<style=title><color=#f97baf><size=42>QUEEN''S BOUNTY

      FREE GAMES</style></color>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=24>- <b>1 Scatter</b> on reel <b>5</b> of each array, <b>2 Scatters</b>
      in total\n  triggers <b>10 Queen's Bounty Free Games</b>.\n\n- During Free
      Games, Wild can appear anywhere \n  on reels for both arrays.\n\n- During <b>Free
      Games</b>, <b>Wild Copy Feature</b>\n  works in both directions.\n\n- No re-trigger
      is allowed."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><color=#f97baf><size=42>LINES</size></style></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_LINES
    value: <size=24>The 2 reel sets have the same pay lines.
